{
 "definitions": {
  "half_keys": "Every {'A','B'} key is the HELD half: the half the true-DI judge (or, for lo_*, the true-DI truth ranking) is scored on. A = 1.0-5.5 s, B = 5.5-10 s of the crop. The search / objective read the OTHER half. 'part' = the repo's own per-part unit (mean over all amps and both directions). 'n' / 'n_amps' = how many amps went into each half mean (3 unless a direction was dropped).",
  "arm_a_gain": "ML plan step 3 (song-settings), arm A = 150-render knob search through C' rebuilt DI, scored by the judge (true measure DI) on the held half: log(d_armA / d_S), d = judge distance to the record, S = the product's starting preset. NEGATIVE = closer to record = better. Per half = mean over amps of the directions held on that half; 'part' = song_readout.part_rows (mean over amps x directions). Source: ~/ndsp-presets/learn/song-settings/armA/<slug>/<amp>/<search>.json ['judge'][held] and knob-ceiling/cells/<slug>/<amp>/result.json menu[start][held] for S; units via learn/song_readout.gather + drop_refused (= arm_a_levers.gathered_units). Reproduces report.json band-weighted -0.0777 exactly.",
  "arm_a_adopted_3Cprime_shrink05_gain": "Extra: arm A's current best adopted 2026-10-16 (arm-a-levers exp 3: search stopped after its 52-render main stage, moves shrunk halfway to S): log(d / d_S) on the held half, same sign. Source: ~/ndsp-presets/learn/song-settings/levers/early/lever-shrink-0.5/<slug>/<amp>/<search>.json, units/drop as arm_a_levers.cmd_report_3. Reproduces doc -0.083 (band-weighted -0.0834).",
  "ks_gain": "K_S = knob_ceiling search from S with the true measure DI, 150 renders per direction (the step-3 ceiling): log(d_K_S / d_S) on the held half. NEGATIVE = better. Source: ~/ndsp-presets/learn/knob-ceiling/cells/<slug>/<amp>/result.json runs[search]['K_S']['held'] vs menu[start][held]; same units as arm_a_gain. Reproduces step-3 report K_S -0.2689. (knob-ceiling-results.md's '(c) -0.253' is the same search on its own 72-cell set, part-weighted; the step-3 figure is what is used here.)",
  "ks_extend_gain_partial": "Extra, PARTIAL: ks-ceiling-extend (K_S continued to a flat stop) is still running (~21 of 144 directions done, at most 1 amp per part-half). log(final.held / S_held) per done direction, keyed by held half. Do not use as a per-part figure. Source: ~/ndsp-presets/learn/ks-ceiling-extend/cells/<slug>/<amp>/<search>.json.",
  "lo_matched_minus_current": "Local objective experiment 1b: per cell (part x amp), Spearman over Sigma (all 4 point sources: S, neighbourhood, K_S paths, arm A paths) between an objective's distances on one half and the TRUE judge (measure DI vs reference.wav) on the other half (learn/local_objective.rho / cross_half). matched = C' rebuilt from the amp track scored vs the amp track (cprime_ref, reference, native lag, own mask); current = C' rebuilt from the htdemucs stem scored vs the stem (cprime, stem, native, own). Value = matched - current. POSITIVE = matched ranks nearby settings better = better. 'part' = mean over amps of (cross_half_matched - cross_half_current), exactly what report-1b's agg(paired(...)) part-means (reproduces band-weighted +0.252, part-weighted +0.299, 20/24 parts positive). Per half 'A'/'B' = mean over amps of the single cross-half term whose TRUTH is on that half (objective read on the other half): rho(obj_other, true_held)_matched - same_current; 'part' ~= mean of A and B. 'matched'/'current' sub-dicts give the two Spearmans themselves. Not stored per part in report-1b.json (it stores only aggregates and per-band); recomputed here from ~/ndsp-presets/learn/local-objective/scores/{measure,cprime,cprime_ref}/<slug>/<amp>.json with sigma.json, using LO.load_sigma, LO._vals, LO.rho, LO.cross_half (asserted equal to LO.subset_measures). Zero renders."
 },
